              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Soup Loving Nicole"
            },
            "reviewBody": "2 cucumbers and 1 bottle of dressing was plenty! I used pickled banana peppers because that is all we have in my area. They worked great. Overall this is a great recipe and I loved the fact that it didn't call for mayo but I do feel some of the veggies need scaled back as to not overshadow the pasta.",
